'''Cowboy''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that is currently obtainable by purchasing the [[Retro Bundle]] for 799 Robux.

== Appearance ==
The blade is dark grey and the handle is white. The entire knife is covered with western-styled engravings. 

== Trivia ==

* It pairs with the [[Vintage Weapons|vintage]] gun [[Cowboy]].
